'''Heart Wand''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]] or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond_icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Day Event]].

== Appearance ==
Instead of being a traditional knife shape, it is a wand. The top of the wand has a large pink heart with golden outlines and a light blue gem at the top end. Below the heart, acting as a guard, are white wings and a pink bow with a blue heart in the center. The handle is pink and white candy cane-like stripes with gold on either of the ends.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Heart Wand]].
* This, [[Candy]], [[BattleAxe]], [[BattleAxe II]], [[Bat]], [[Turkey]], [[Evergreen]], and [[Embersickle]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.

